# Close the AI sheet (HOME) after asking, before the answer's speech arrives: the late speech must
# not play (the platform doc: HOME/BACK close the sheet and stop playback). Before the fix (audit
# AUD-006, 2026-11) the whole answer played after the sheet was gone (10.7 s of audio).
@3s      tap   68% 92%        # 阅读
+2500ms  tap   50% 160dp          # 星星邮差
+3s      mic   speech
+0ms     key   ai 1500ms          # hold to talk, release at +1.5 s
+2000ms  key   home               # 0.5 s after release (the hub answers ~1.7 s after release)
+12s     snap  after
+1s      end
